# Contract: qa/contracts/docker.md D6 -- `.env`, `projects/` and `profiles/` are bind-mounted
# from the host and must NOT be baked into the image (`docs/` is bind-mounted too, but it is public
# and harmless to bake). The repo is public and the Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so anything not
# listed here (credentials, signed run approvals, browser login state, crawl data, live-session
# snapshots) would ship inside every built image. Patterns use `**/` so nested copies match too.
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
.git/
.work/
.worktrees/

# Secrets and per-project state (D6).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
**/projects/
**/profiles/
qa/evidence/

# Dev-session residue: agent worktrees, live-session page snapshots, handoff notes, task state.
.claude/
.codex/
.playwright-mcp/
.handoffs/
.goal/
at113-fixture-*/
pytest-of-*/
